","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_7","text":"What about you, Rapi? Are you hungry?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_8","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_9","text":"Yes, I'm hungry as well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_10","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_10","text":"We can buy staples later. For now, let's eat here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_11","text":"... Okay.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_12","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_12","text":"40 minutes later.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_13","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_13","text":"This is a nice restaurant.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_14","text":"Yes, the chef seems quite talented.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_15","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_15","text":"How'd you find the meal?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_16","text":"It was lovely.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_17","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_17","text":"Next time, we can order whatever your favorite food is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_18","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_19","text":"I don't really have a favorite food.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_20","text":"I eat pretty much anything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_21","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_21","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_22","text":"I'm sorry.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_23","text":"I didn't mean to make things awkward.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_24","text":"I just wanted to illustrate how strong my mental fortitude is in that regard.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_25","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_25","text":"Your mental fortitude?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_26","text":"Yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_27","text":"Theoretically, Nikkes do not need to consume food.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_28","text":"We are powered by the core within our bodies.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_29","text":"The core is capable of generating its own power, and as long as there is no major damage, it can be used without any active input on our part.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_30","text":"We do not need to consume food for energy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_31","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_31","text":"Then, why did you...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_32","text":"As I mentioned earlier, it all has to do with the mind.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_33","text":"With the exception of the brain, Nikkes are composed entirely of artificial materials.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_34","text":"We are not human.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_35","text":"But in terms of our appearance, we are a perfect copy of a human being, down to our internal structure.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_36","text":"Because of that, most Nikkes use their bodies just as humans do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_37","text":"There are pros and cons to this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_38","text":"It allows us to blend in and interact with the rest of society.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_39","text":"However, some may experience a mental breakdown when they become aware they are not human.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_40","text":"We look identical to humans and act just like them, so when we are told we are in fact not human, it can cause a kind of panic to arise within us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_41","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_41","text":"Can this panic also occur when you meet someone who is Nikkephobe?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Cafe","bgArt":"cafe","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["adultwoman"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_42","text":"No. Cursing or physical violence only results in slight emotional agitation. Unpleasant thoughts, feelings of anger, things of that nature.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_43","text":"It only becomes serious upon negation of our primary mechanisms.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Restaurant","bgArt":"restaurant","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["rapi"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_44","text":"Food is a prime example.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_45","text":"The moment you realize that you don't have to eat anymore...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_46","text":"You instantly become acutely aware that you are different from humans.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_47","text":"This results in a sort of cognitive dissonance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_48","text":"Your mental state is negatively impacted.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_49","text":"The degree of this impact differs from Nikke to Nikke.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_50","text":"There are some who need to eat three meals a day in order to feel a sense of stability.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"NikkeRoom","bgArt":"nikkeroom","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["belorta"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_51","text":"Then there are others like me, who are able to get by eating once every few days.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["rapi"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_52","text":"It's the same with sleep and hygiene.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"ShowerRoom","bgArt":"showerroom","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_53","text":"We don't feel tired if we don't sleep, and we do not smell even if we do not wash.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_54","text":"However, if we don't sleep and wash, then we become aware.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Restaurant","bgArt":"restaurant","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["rapi"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_55","text":"Aware that we are different from humans.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_56","text":"This extends to more than just our daily habits.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_57","text":"In the early days, the liquid catalysts in our bodies were green.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_58","text":"However, whenever we were injured, the sight of green blood spilling from our wounds would result in cognitive dissonance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_59","text":"In later models, they switched to red.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_60","text":"Eyeballs with ultra-precise cameras implanted, missiles embedded in the abdomen, and booster-mounted legs.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_61","text":"Yes, they were superior in terms of performance, but they were all discarded due to the users being unable to process them mentally.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_62","text":"This is the reason why most Nikkes use handheld firearms along with other assistive equipment.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_63","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_63","text":"What happens if the cognitive dissonance becomes too great?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_64","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_65","text":"A Mind Switch.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_66","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_66","text":"Mind Switch?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_67","text":"Yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_68","text":"Simply put, the personality changes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_69","text":"I don't know the details...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_70","text":"Once the brain determines it can no longer cope with the cognitive dissonance, it undergoes a radical change.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_71","text":"On rare occasions, the new personality that emerges is perfectly fine.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_72","text":"Most of the time however, they go insane.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_73","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_73","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_74","text":"Nikkes that experience a Mind Switch are referred to as Irregulars.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_75","text":"As most Irregulars have destructive tendencies, and are usually terminated.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_76","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_76","text":"Is there no way to fix it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_77","text":"I don't know if \"fix\" is the proper term to describe it...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_78","text":"But, the process can be reverted through a reboot.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_79","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_79","text":"Reboot?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_80","text":"It's exactly what it sounds like. You wipe the Nikke's memory clean.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_81","text":"You revert the mind to the way it was the day before, or even as far back as when they were first manufactured.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_82","text":"However, the success rate is low.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_83","text":"When one becomes an Irregular, their brain is physically broken.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_84","text":"I've heard there is a brainwashing technique that makes the brain a total blank slate.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_85","text":"But I've never heard of any cases where it was actually used.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_86","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_87","text":"Because of all this...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_88","text":"The Central Government places a high importance on maintaining Nikkes' mental health.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_89","text":"A Nikke can become a massive liability if they become an Irregular.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_90","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_90","text":"I won't let that happen to any of you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_91","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_92","text":"Well... I'm glad to hear that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_93","text":"I've gone on for far too long.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_rapi_04_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_rapi_04_94","text":"Should we get going?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affini